                            "Sum of ([DefoliationManager].Script.DefoliatedWt*10.0) from 1-Jun to [Clock].Today as CumDefoliatedWt",
                            "Sum of ([AGPRyegrass].HarvestedWt + [AGPWhiteClover].HarvestedWt) from 1-Jun to [Clock].Today as CumDefoliatedWt2",
                            "",
                            "Mean of ([AgPWhiteClover].AboveGroundWt/([AgPRyegrass].AboveGroundWt + [AgPWhiteClover].AboveGroundWt + 0.000000001)) from 1-Jun to [Clock].Today as AvgCloverContent"
